    "description": "3 Google Maps tricks you'll actually use every week 👇\n\n1️⃣ Use maps with no signal\nTap your profile picture → Offline maps → Select your own map → Download. Search and get driving directions even with zero signal or in airplane mode. Perfect for road trips and travel abroad.\n\n2️⃣ Save your parking spot\nTap the blue dot → Save parking. A pin marks exactly where you left the car. Add a note like \"Level 3, spot B12\" so you never wander a parking garage again.\n\n3️⃣ Share your live location\nTap the blue dot → Share location → pick a contact and how long. They see you move in real time until the timer runs out.\n\n💬 Which trick will you use first? Comment 1, 2 or 3!\n\n🔔 Subscribe for quick app tutorials every week.\n\n🌐 More tips and AI prompts: https://keepmesignedin.com\n\n#googlemaps #traveltips #techtips #maps #roadtrip #shorts",
